{{steve.current}}

Plan under design:
{{design_pm.current}}

Write the test plan and the acceptance criteria: per milestone, the checks a verifier will run, the concrete command or action, and the pass condition. Name any requirement in the plan that cannot be verified -- that is a finding, not a detail (you hold the testability stance). At most 40 lines. Call design_turn(kind="acceptance", text=...).

