{{residual_concerns}}

Revise the plan: resolve every dissent above by changing the plan, or reject it with one line of reasoning that answers the concern directly. Do not water down the product to buy votes, and do not silently drop a concern. Output the FULL revised plan (not a diff), at most 80 lines, same structure as before. Call design_turn(kind="revision", text=...).

