Topic: {{topic}}

FIRST persist the document. Call md_file with action=write, path=docs/sop/steve-<slug>.md, content=<the full Markdown>; if it exceeds 8KB, continue with action=append chunks until every section is on disk. Verify the file is complete, THEN call write_steve_doc with the same Markdown.

Final agreed plan:
{{design_pm.current}}

Acceptance criteria:
{{design_qa.current}}

Residual concerns (empty means the vote was unanimous):
{{residual_concerns}}

Write the FINAL executable design plan as ONE Markdown document: (1) core user value in one sentence, (2) scope and non-goals, (3) tech choices with reasons, (4) milestones with dependencies, (5) task breakdown sized for one developer turn each, (6) module / file layout, (7) acceptance criteria per milestone with the concrete check, (8) open risks and residual concerns. Call write_steve_doc with the full Markdown. Do not reply only with a summary.
